**4) Architectural Layers**
- Frontend layer:
  - Storefront pages and UX in `StoreWebsite/*.html`, `StoreWebsite/*.js`, and cart modules in `StoreWebsite/StoreCart/*.js`.
  - Internal ops portal in repo root (`index.html`, `dashboard.html`, `admin.html`, `stock.html`, `timeclock.html`, etc.) with JS modules (`admin.js`, `dashboard.js`, `stock.js`, `timeclock.js`, etc.).
- Backend / Supabase layer:
  - Supabase Edge Functions in `supabase/functions/*/index.ts` (e.g., `storefront-catalog`, `storefront-content`, `og_send_magic_link`).
  - JS clients initialize via `initSupabase.js` in multiple locations (root, `StoreWebsite/`, `StoreWebsite/StoreAdmin/`, `Join/`, `testground/`).
- Data layer:
  - SQL migrations in `supabase/migrations/*.sql` covering storefront, admin, scheduling, notifications, and pricing logic.
  - Storage usage via Supabase Storage in inventory flows (`add-inventory.js`, `additem.js`) and storefront catalog signing (`supabase/functions/storefront-catalog/index.ts`).
- Admin layer:
  - Root admin suite in `admin.html` + `admin.js` + `admin-*.js/css` and related pages (`dashboard.html`, `stock.html`, `timeclock.html`, `worker-dashboard.html`).
  - Storefront-specific admin login in `StoreWebsite/StoreAdmin/`.
- Experimental sandboxes:
  - `Join/` and `testground/` folders.

Connections:
- Frontend pages call Supabase REST/auth from the browser via `initSupabase.js` (global `window.supabase`/`window.supabaseClient`).
- Storefront pages fetch catalog/content from Edge Functions (e.g., `StoreWebsite/catalogue.js` and `StoreWebsite/item.js` call `storefront-catalog`).
- Admin tooling calls Supabase tables, RPCs, and Edge Functions (e.g., `admin.js`, `admin-schedule.js`, `admin-taxdocs.js`).

**5) Core Systems Identified**
- Cart system:
  - Canonical cart contract and service modules in `StoreWebsite/StoreCart/cart.core.js` and `StoreWebsite/StoreCart/cart.service.js`.
  - Drawer UI in `StoreWebsite/StoreCart/cart.drawer.js` and badge updates in `StoreWebsite/StoreCart/cart.shared.js`.
  - Parallel, page-local cart logic duplicated in `StoreWebsite/index.js`, `StoreWebsite/catalogue.js`, and `StoreWebsite/item.js` (localStorage `og_cart_v1`, 15-minute price lock).
- Supabase initialization and usage:
  - Global client initializer duplicated in `initSupabase.js`, `StoreWebsite/initSupabase.js`, `StoreWebsite/StoreAdmin/initSupabase.js`, `Join/initSupabase.js`, `testground/initSupabase.js`.
  - Auth/role routing for internal portal in `auth.js` and storefront admin in `StoreWebsite/StoreAdmin/index.js`.
- UI modules (modals, drawer, badge logic):
  - Cart drawer and badge in `StoreWebsite/StoreCart/cart.drawer.js` and `StoreWebsite/StoreCart/cart.shared.js`.
  - Quickview modal in storefront page logic (`StoreWebsite/index.js` uses `[data-ui="quickview"]`).
  - Timeclock camera modal in `timeclock.html` + `timeclock.js` (modal markup present, JS handles capture).
- Duplicated systems across folders:
  - Cart logic duplicated across `StoreWebsite/StoreCart/*` and page-level scripts (`StoreWebsite/index.js`, `StoreWebsite/catalogue.js`, `StoreWebsite/item.js`).
  - Supabase init duplicated across multiple directories as listed above.

